Subject: [PATCH] XR: single generic netlink owner for PPE bridge templates

Owner decision 2026-10-11: L2 templates are published only through the
xr_ppe_l2 generic netlink family (CAP_NET_ADMIN), never through TC. PUBLISH
validates the live bridge (ports, MTU, policy flags, MST, per-VLAN state,
PVID, FDB direction, local destination) under RTNL, derives the bridge's own
egress tagging, and commits only if the caller's generation is still current.
Revoked entries stay owned until REVOKE; DUMP marks itself interrupted when
the generation or owner set changes so collectors can retry. TC REPLACE of a
bridge template is rejected. Templates stay inert while boot-only PPE bind
permissions are off. NPU/PPE opt-ins remain disabled.

